# Spider-Verse: "You don't have to put legendary Spiders you control into your graveyard because of the legend rule" (the legend rule, CR
# 704.5j, stops applying to your legendary Spiders). Bot1 controls Spider-Verse and, on turns three and five, casts two Spider-Gwen, Free
# Spirit: both stay. On turn seven it casts two Ragavan, Nimble Pilferer, not a Spider: the rule applies and one goes to the graveyard. On
# turn two Bot2 - Spider-Verse is not its own - casts two Spider-Gwens and keeps one: the rule applies to an opponent's Spiders.

